sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PER001 as PER-001 (Personal Customer)
    participant CH001 as CH-001 (Online Banking Portal)
    participant CAP001 as CAP-001 API (SVC-001)
    participant EventBus as Event Bus (SVC-102)
    participant CAP003 as CAP-003 API (SVC-009)
    participant CAP005 as CAP-005 (SVC-014/SVC-051)
    participant EXTCOP as EXT: Pay.UK CoP Service
    participant OPS001 as OPS-001 (MLRO/Operations)

    Note over PER001,CAP001: PH-077: Payment Initiation
    PER001->>CH001: Enter payment details
    CH001->>CAP001: POST /chaps-payments
    CAP001--)EventBus: publish CHAPSPaymentIntentCreated EVT-108

    Note over CAP003,EXTCOP: PH-078: CoP Check (passes)
    EventBus--)CAP003: EVT-108 consumed — CoP check
    CAP003->>EXTCOP: CoP request
    EXTCOP-->>CAP003: result=match
    CAP003--)EventBus: publish CHAPSCoPCheckCompleted EVT-109

    Note over CAP005: PH-079: Sanctions Screening — HIT
    EventBus--)CAP005: EVT-108 consumed — sanctions screening
    CAP005->>CAP005: SVC-014 → SVC-051 — SANCTIONS HIT DETECTED
    CAP005--)EventBus: publish SanctionsHitDetected EVT-006
    EventBus--)CAP001: EVT-006 consumed — status→failed, funds unreserved
    EventBus--)OPS001: MLRO alert: sanctions hit on CHAPS payment

    Note over CH001,PER001: Payment Blocked (Tipping-Off Prohibition)
    CH001->>CAP001: GET /chaps-payments/{id}
    CAP001-->>CH001: 200 status=failed (no sanctions detail)
    CH001->>PER001: We are unable to process this payment
    Note over PER001: POCA 2002 s333A: no sanctions context disclosed to customer
